00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:13.100
Looks like the coast is clear.

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:16.110
Well, we've been staying
here in disguise, after all.

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:18.250
Hey! Welcome back.

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:20.890
Where did you two go this time?

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:24.750
To Tokyo. To see my granddaughter.

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:26.860
She's starting elementary school, isn't she?

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:28.210
That's something to look forward to!

