00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:17.380
<i>I know!</i>

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:21.260
<i>I use PeopleLog to expand my customer 
base by finding fishing enthusiasts.</i>

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:23.750
<i>Gotta bring my business to 
the folks who need it, right?</i>

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.490
