of my café without permission!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:27.980
<b>Is this broad one of Lupin's gang?</b>

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:29.610
<b>It's Lupin's girlfriend lol</b>

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:30.740
<b>That makes her a crook, too</b>

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.070
