00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:42.570
Well, well, looks like 
trouble's brewing out here.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.160
Go on inside.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:49.130
I'll listen to what they have to say.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.600
It's dangerous! These 
people are acting crazy.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:01.110
Our PeopleLog does more than 
just standard facial recognition.

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:03.940
It can analyze features, 
and use what it's learned

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:06.570
from past disguises to see 
through new ones, too.

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:09.900
<b>It's Lupin!!</b>

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.400
<b>That's a disguise, huh?</b>

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.190
<b>Wow, this really must be his hideout!</b>

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:12.240
<b>PeopleLog is awesome!</b>

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.030
Well, if the cat's out the bag...

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:20.570
It's Lupin!

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.860
