00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:24.880
Hey!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:25.790
<b>He took a hostage!?</b>

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:26.540
<b>That's dirty, omg</b>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:27.170
<b>Is this how a "master
 thief" does things?</b>

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.170
<b>He's just a no-good
 stinkin' criminal!</b>

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:28.920
<b>Make a dash for it, lady!!</b>

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.380
<b>Just turn yourself in already!</b>

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:31.620
Lupin!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:36.380
